      "en": "In this confidence, I was determined to come first to you, that you might have a second benefit,",
      "ko": "내가 이 확신을 가지고 너희로 두번 은혜를 얻게 하기 위하여 먼저 너희에게 이르렀다가",
      "source_text_hash": "b360e2b18e2019ed5b066ab1f1e4ccca05886f3225f22e2f14af3fc169319f65",
      "translation_text_hash": "046c0726c4611f37ec0e5902bc2661d209f97b2bfd8e4580dc1a325e947b7310",
